<title>USA: Hartmarx Corp Q3 Aug 31 net higher.</title>
<headline>Hartmarx Corp Q3 Aug 31 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.09   profit	$ 0.07</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,131   profit	 2,175</p>
<p> Revs		     164,905		  166,659</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,093		   32,679</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		$ 0.01     loss     $  0.58</p>
<p> Net profit		   521     loss	19,040</p>
<p> Revs		     450,017		  450,971</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  32,965		   32,598</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months net includes loss from continuing operations equal to $0.01 a share and gain from some senior notes equal to $0.02 a share.</p>
<p>1995 nine months net includes loss from continuing operations equal to $0.02 a share and a loss from discontinued Kuppenheimer operation equal to $0.56 a share.</p>
<p>	     Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
